From: MISNET BSP maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: add MISNET ES001 RevA dev and product variants

Give the development and product profiles independent DTB names and DTS
entry points. Both initially include the NXP i.MX93 11x11 EVK board DTS
without hardware changes; board-specific settings can be added separately.

---
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/Makefile
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/Makefile
@@ -496,1 +496,4 @@
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MXC) += imx93-11x11-misnet-es001-reva-dev.dtb
+dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MXC) += imx93-11x11-misnet-es001-reva-product.dtb
+
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_MXC) += imx93-11x11-frdm.dtb imx93-11x11-frdm-8mic-reve.dtb \
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx93-11x11-misnet-es001-reva-dev.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx93-11x11-misnet-es001-reva-dev.dts
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx93-11x11-misnet-es001-reva-dev.dts
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0+ OR MIT)
+/*
+ * Copyright 2026 Misnet
+ */
+
+/* ES001 RevA development profile; start from the NXP EVK baseline. */
+#include "imx93-11x11-evk.dts"
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx93-11x11-misnet-es001-reva-product.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx93-11x11-misnet-es001-reva-product.dts
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/freescale/imx93-11x11-misnet-es001-reva-product.dts
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0+ OR MIT)
+/*
+ * Copyright 2026 Misnet
+ */
+
+/* ES001 RevA product profile; start from the NXP EVK baseline. */
+#include "imx93-11x11-evk.dts"
